# Shibuya Notes

**10/31/2018**

The date keeps appearing in every report.

The same date.

The same location.

The same face.

Shibuya was already in chaos when the barriers went up.

Gojo was sealed.

The curses were organized.

Everything seemed too deliberate to be coincidence.

And then Geto appeared.

That was the moment the entire situation became difficult to explain.

If Geto had been alive, none of this would have been surprising.

But he wasn't.

I keep asking the same question:

**Who benefits from wearing a dead man's face?**

I have not found an answer.

Not one that I am willing to write down yet.
